{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2025-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1735689600, "end_date": 1738367999, "month_true_total": 16, "quota": 16, "returned": 16, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:55:00 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "186822923", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360109741", "personaname": "Ciocolici", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ciocolici/", "num_games_owned": 531, "num_reviews": 320, "playtime_forever": 23, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1751635479, "avatar": "0d1abdf8608e2e24956a5b55e55cb810e788e356"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mass Effect 3 is a masterpiece and a perfect conclusion to the trilogy, with refined gameplay, intense action, and some of the best storytelling in gaming. Every choice feels impactful, and the deep, well-written characters make the journey unforgettable. While the ending remains divisive, I personally found it satisfying. If you're jumping in, go for Mass Effect: Legendary Edition, it’s the definitive way to experience the trilogy, with better visuals and fewer bugs (though no multiplayer). This series is a timeless classic, and Mass Effect 3 cements its place as one of the greatest games ever made.", "timestamp_created": 1738331296, "timestamp_updated": 1741306806, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.554834663867950439", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186783322", "author": {"steamid": "76561198862026205", "personaname": "Avasquado", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198862026205/", "num_games_owned": 154, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1713, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 