ensh1ttification and militant anti-consumerism sunk its claws ALL the way into Bioware doesn't mean it's unaffected by it.  In this case, all DLC material  is relegated to EA servers which means that if EA servers go down then not only is the DLC material not accessible to you, but any of your saved games that were started with the DLC material intact will not be playable, which effectively renders the game as unplayable as Battlefield and FIFA when the EA servers crash.\n\nThe last great game Bioware made is unfortunately still partially ensh1ttificated by EA.  A pity.  But it's still worth playing, and if you're looking for intricate continuity in the story, dialogue, and lore then nobody has done it like the OG Mass Effect trilogy, before or since.", "timestamp_created": 1737910533, "timestamp_updated": 1737910533, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598438680171966553", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186462662", "author": {"steamid": "76561198992643844", "personaname": "Xx_Calcium_Crusader_xX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BJOutlook/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 444, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 295, "last_played": 1737914347, "avatar": "5f36606829e4481e5c7fc98e23568ac25f0eb622"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud gaem", "timestamp_created": 1737904355, "timestamp_updated": 1737904355, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "186436954", "author": {"s